        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-3.63,\\quad -3.6\\dot{3},\\quad -3\\frac{7}{11},\\quad -3.\\dot{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-3\\frac{7}{11}&=-3.636363\\ldots\\\\-3.6\\dot{3}&=-3.633333\\ldots\\\\-3.63&=-3.630000\\ldots\\\\-3.\\dot{6}&=-3.666666\\ldots\\end{align*}$$\nThe negative number with the smaller magnitude is greater. Hence the decreasing order is\n$$-3.63>-3.6\\dot{3}>-3\\frac{7}{11}>-3.\\dot{6}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-challenge-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$-1.43\\dot{5},\\quad -1.4\\dot{3}\\dot{5},\\quad -1\\frac{4}{9},\\quad -1.\\dot{4}3\\dot{5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-1.4\\dot{3}\\dot{5},\\quad -1.\\dot{4}3\\dot{5},\\quad -1.43\\dot{5},\\quad -1\\frac{4}{9}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-1.43\\dot{5}&=-1.435555\\ldots\\\\-1.4\\dot{3}\\dot{5}&=-1.435353\\ldots\\\\-1\\frac{4}{9}&=-1.444444\\ldots\\\\-1.\\dot{4}3\\dot{5}&=-1.435435\\ldots\\end{align*}$$\nThe negative number with the smaller magnitude is greater. Hence the decreasing order is\n$$-1.4\\dot{3}\\dot{5}>-1.\\dot{4}3\\dot{5}>-1.43\\dot{5}>-1\\frac{4}{9}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
